  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Three a.m.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.11,
      "first": 0,
      "last": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The city's asleep.",
      "start": 1.8,
      "end": 2.95,
      "first": 2,
      "last": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "But you're not.",
      "start": 3.46,
      "end": 4.16,
      "first": 5,
      "last": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "You've got an idea.",
      "start": 4.59,
      "end": 5.58,
      "first": 8,
      "last": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The kind that won't let you rest.",
      "start": 5.86,
      "end": 7.44,
      "first": 12,
      "last": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "And you know,",
      "start": 8.33,
      "end": 8.86,
      "first": 19,
      "last": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "if it works...",
      "start": 9.09,
      "end": 9.92,
      "first": 22,
      "last": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "it won't just change your life.",
      "start": 10.2,
      "end": 11.7,
      "first": 25,
      "last": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "It could reach the whole world.",
      "start": 12.15,
      "end": 13.86,
      "first": 31,
      "last": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "But the world doesn't wait.",
      "start": 14.39,
      "end": 15.54,
      "first": 37,
      "last": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "A server that crawls. A site that crashes on launch day.",
      "start": 15.72,
      "end": 18.88,
      "first": 42,
      "last": 52
    },
    {
      "text": "Dashboards you need a manual to understand.",
      "start": 19.07,
      "end": 21.22,
      "first": 53,
      "last": 59
    },
    {
      "text": "And somewhere in all of that...",
      "start": 21.66,
      "end": 22.95,
      "first": 60,
      "last": 65
    },
    {
      "text": "the dream gets heavy.",
      "start": 23.34,
      "end": 24.47,
      "first": 66,
      "last": 69
    },
    {
      "text": "So we built something different.",
      "start": 24.85,
      "end": 26.37,
      "first": 70,
      "last": 74
    },
    {
      "text": "This is SatisfyCloud.",
      "start": 26.66,
      "end": 28.27,
      "first": 75,
      "last": 77
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with a name.",
      "start": 28.59,
      "end": 29.42,
      "first": 78,
      "last": 81
    },
    {
      "text": "Your domain,",
      "start": 29.61,
      "end": 30.26,
      "first": 82,
      "last": 83
    },
    {
      "text": "live in seconds.",
      "start": 30.44,
      "end": 31.48,
      "first": 84,
      "last": 86
    },
    {
      "text": "Give it a home, on blazing-fast NVMe, with LiteSpeed speed.",
      "start": 31.72,
      "end": 35.68,
      "first": 87,
      "last": 96
    },
    {
      "text": "Grow into Pro, with full terminal and SSH.",
      "start": 35.94,
      "end": 38.77,
      "first": 97,
      "last": 104
    },
    {
      "text": "Launch your own hosting brand, completely white-label.",
      "start": 38.98,
      "end": 41.86,
      "first": 105,
      "last": 111
    },
    {
      "text": "Need raw power?",
      "start": 42.09,
      "end": 42.9,
      "first": 112,
      "last": 114
    },
    {
      "text": "Full-root VPS on AMD EPYC. Bare-metal servers across eight countries.",
      "start": 43.15,
      "end": 47.66,
      "first": 115,
      "last": 124
    },
    {
      "text": "And for gamers?",
      "start": 47.87,
      "end": 48.62,
      "first": 125,
      "last": 127
    },
    {
      "text": "Ultra-low latency. Anti-DDoS armor. Deployed in an instant.",
      "start": 48.79,
      "end": 52.99,
      "first": 128,
      "last": 135
    },
    {
      "text": "Your email, on your own domain. Scaling that's elastic, exactly when you need it.",
      "start": 53.22,
      "end": 57.87,
      "first": 136,
      "last": 149
    },
    {
